{
  "about": "The city each US library page shows (tools/seo/check-pages.mjs) where it differs from the directory's: a branch's town, a county, a township name, a missing or a wrong city. Every value is the city of the library system's own administrative entity in the IMLS Public Libraries Survey FY2024 (the administrative entity file, joined to the directory by FSCSKEY), copied with that record; a city is never taken from a library's name. Only a library that is one system with its own record in the federal list has one: a consortium's shared catalog, or a member library without a record of its own, keeps the directory's city, except where the federal list shows that city is no place of the catalog (city null: the page shows the state only). A city that differs only in capitals, accents or St./Saint is not listed. replaces: the directory's city when the value was copied (a test checks it still is). on: the date the page changed. Pages only: the app's directory, its search and its /select/ links are unchanged.",
